<!-- Section: Introduction -->
<section class="mb-5">
    <p class="lead">
        This guide demonstrates how to perform CRUD operations in a full-stack app with <strong>React</strong> and <strong>ASP.NET Core Web API</strong> using <strong>two related tables</strong>: <code>Category</code> and <code>Product</code>. Each product belongs to one category.
    </p>
</section>

